{"id":"n1-056","title":"Noun にあっては (Noun ni atte ha)","jlptLevel":1,"shortExplanation":"Indicates a specific situation or environment in which something happens or is the case.","longExplanation":"The にあっては grammar point is used after a noun that indicates a specific situation or environment. It expresses the context in which an event takes place, or the circumstances that pertain to the information to be explained or highlighted. It can be translated as 'in', 'at' or 'under' in English.","formation":"Noun + にあっては","examples":[{"jp":"戦争時にあっては、すべての人々が困難に直面していました。","romaji":"Sensouji ni atte wa, subete no hito ga konnan ni chokumen shiteimashita.","en":"In wartime, all people were facing difficulties.","words":[{"surface":"戦争","vocabId":"1390360","reading":"せんそう"},{"surface":"時","vocabId":"1315840","reading":"とき"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"あっ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"すべて","vocabId":"1595730","reading":"すべて"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"人々","vocabId":"1580650","reading":"ひとびと"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"困難","vocabId":"1289620","reading":"こんなん"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"直面","vocabId":"1431540","reading":"ちょくめん"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"い","vocabId":"1158500","reading":"い"},{"surface":"まし","vocabId":null},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]},{"jp":"経済危機にあっては、多くの企業が倒産の危機に瀕している。","romaji":"Keizai kiki ni atte wa, ooku no kigyou ga tousan no kiki ni hinshite iru.","en":"In the economic crisis, many companies are on the verge of bankruptcy.","words":[{"surface":"経済","vocabId":"1251320","reading":"けいざい"},{"surface":"危機","vocabId":"1218450","reading":"きき"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"あっ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"多く","vocabId":"1861770","reading":"おおく"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"企業","vocabId":"1218190","reading":"きぎょう"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"倒産","vocabId":"1445890","reading":"とうさん"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"危機","vocabId":"1218450","reading":"きき"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"瀕","vocabId":"2648780","reading":"ひん"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いる","vocabId":"1577980","reading":"いる"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]},{"jp":"不況下にあっては、どの企業も経費削減を迫られている。","romaji":"Fukyouka ni atte wa, dono kigyou mo keihi sakugen o semararete iru.","en":"In times of recession, every company is forced to cut costs.","words":[{"surface":"不況","vocabId":"1491950","reading":"ふきょう"},{"surface":"下","vocabId":"1184140","reading":"した"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"あっ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"どの","vocabId":null},{"surface":"企業","vocabId":"1218190","reading":"きぎょう"},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"経費","vocabId":"1251640","reading":"けいひ"},{"surface":"削減","vocabId":"1298110","reading":"さくげん"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"迫ら","vocabId":"1475720","reading":"せまる"},{"surface":"れ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いる","vocabId":"1577980","reading":"いる"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]},{"jp":"改革期にあっては、新しいアイデアを大切にする必要がある。","romaji":"Kaikaku ki ni atte wa, atarashii aidea o taisetsu ni suru hitsuyou ga aru.","en":"In a period of reform, it's necessary to value new ideas.","words":[{"surface":"改革","vocabId":"1200780","reading":"かいかく"},{"surface":"期","vocabId":"1220540","reading":"き"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"あっ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"新しい","vocabId":"1361490","reading":"あたらしい"},{"surface":"アイデア","vocabId":null},{"su